diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index d998161..5b0aade 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Rename preserves import bindings.** Class renames update every matching import while retaining explicit aliases and choosing available names for collisions. Moving grouped imports keeps unrelated bindings and surrounding code. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Named trait aliases keep their identity.** Rename follows composed aliases without changing independent methods, and definition navigation follows their original implementation. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Rename against current files.** Checked editor requests reject stale source versions and contents before preparing changes. Cross-file rename also refreshes newly discovered callers after pending edits. Files outside a project keep their own symbol context instead of selecting a same-name declaration inside it. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Keep Eloquent pivot suggestions current.** Concurrent relationship indexing no longer leaves target-model completion cached without its pivot accessor. New relationship edits supersede older rebuilds. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
